    "confidence": "medium",
    "notes": "Components are the bridge proxy’s net ERC-20 deltas across the six campaign transactions the attacker sent to its exploit contract between blocks 19723701 and 19723925. All three tokens are thin, so the DefiLlama unit prices, observed 98 to 167 seconds before the anchor, are a mark-to-market figure rather than a realisable one, which is why confidence is medium; contemporaneous reporting put the loss near USD 1.6 million. Nothing was recovered."
